// Room's IWADINFO: the Doom-engine records of GZDoom's
// wadsrc_extra/static/iwadinfo.txt (GPL-3.0, like Room), copied unchanged
// (FreeDM through DOOM 2: Hell on Earth), with its Names and Order lists
// cut to those records. Heretic, Hexen, Strife, Chex Quest and the other
// non-id games are left out until Room plays them.
//
// `detect_iwad` takes the first record, in file order, whose MustContain
// lumps are all present, so records go from most to least specific:
// Freedoom (marked by its FREEDOOM / FREEDM lump) before id's IWADs, and
// Doom II, whose only requirement is MAP01, last.

